      "end_time": 4.805,
      "transcript": "ਸਲੋਕ ਮਹਲਾ ਪੰਜਵਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00002",
      "start_time": 12.4,
      "end_time": 18.615,
      "transcript": "ਕਾਮੁ ਨ ਕਰਹੀ ਆਪਣਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00003",
      "start_time": 19.16,
      "end_time": 25.345,
      "transcript": "ਫਿਰਹਿ ਅਵਤਾ ਲੋਇ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00004",
      "start_time": 25.805,
      "end_time": 31.985,
      "transcript": "ਨਾਨਕ ਨਾਇ ਵਿਸਾਰਿਐ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00005",
      "start_time": 32.495,
      "end_time": 38.96,
      "transcript": "ਸੁਖੁ ਕਿਨੇਹਾ ਹੋਇ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00006",
      "start_time": 38.96,
      "end_time": 42.375,
      "transcript": "ਮਹਲਾ ਪੰਜਵਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00007",
      "start_time": 49.015,
      "end_time": 55.285,
      "transcript": "ਬਿਖੈ ਕਉੜਤਣਿ ਸਗਲ ਮਾਹਿ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00008",
      "start_time": 55.72,
      "end_time": 61.915,
      "transcript": "ਜਗਤਿ ਰਹੀ ਲਪਟਾਇ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00009",
      "start_time": 62.44,
      "end_time": 68.565,
      "transcript": "ਨਾਨਕ ਜਨਿ ਵੀਚਾਰਿਆ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00010",
      "start_time": 68.885,
      "end_time": 75.035,
      "transcript": "ਮੀਠਾ ਹਰਿ ਕਾ ਨਾਉ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00011",
      "start_time": 75.6,
      "end_time": 78.455,
      "transcript": "ਪਉੜੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00012",
      "start_time": 78.8,
      "end_time": 87.345,
      "transcript": "ਇਹ ਨੀਸਾਣੀ ਸਾਧ ਕੀ, ਜਿਸੁ ਭੇਟਤ ਤਰੀਐ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00013",
      "start_time": 87.345,
      "end_time": 95.92,
      "transcript": "ਜਮਕੰਕਰੁ ਨੇੜਿ ਨ ਆਵਈ, ਫਿਰਿ ਬਹੁੜਿ ਨ ਮਰੀਐ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00014",
      "start_time": 95.92,
      "end_time": 104.225,
      "transcript": "ਭਵ ਸਾਗਰੁ ਸੰਸਾਰੁ ਬਿਖੁ, ਸੋ ਪਾਰਿ ਉਤਰੀਐ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00015",
      "start_time": 104.525,
      "end_time": 113.16,
      "transcript": "ਹਰਿ ਗੁਣ ਗੁੰਫਹੁ ਮਨਿ ਮਾਲ ਹਰਿ, ਸਭ ਮਲੁ ਪਰਹਰੀਐ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00016",
      "start_time": 113.16,
      "end_time": 122.395,
      "transcript": "ਨਾਨਕ ਪ੍ਰੀਤਮ ਮਿਲਿ ਰਹੇ, ਪਾਰਬ੍ਰਹਮ ਨਰਹਰੀਐ"
    }
  ]
}
